Package: com.mikiyan1978.switchergrid
Name: SwitcherGrid
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: iPad-style grid App Switcher with swipe-down kill-all (Apple's own switcher style, no custom layout code). Includes Kill Guard (protect chosen apps from kill-all, single-app swipe-kill always still works) and Stay Foreground (keeps protected apps genuinely running through backgrounding and resprings, not just a UI flag). Pair with JetsamBoostDaemon for jetsam priority protection under memory pressure.
Maintainer: mikiyan1978
Author: mikiyan1978
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader, com.opa334.altlist
Icon: /Library/PreferenceBundles/SwitcherGridPrefs.bundle/icon@3x.png
